NOTES AND QUESTIONS ON CONNECTU V. ZUCKERBERG
1. The court’s opinion does not make factual findings regarding the citizenship of TheFacebook, Inc., which was also a defendant. Nor does it make findings as to whether ConnectU LLC was a citizen of any other state in addition to New York. (As you will see below, entities such as LLCs can be citizens of more than one state at a given time.) Are the court’s factual findings sufficient to determine the question of diversity jurisdiction?

2. Based on these facts, did Mark Zuckerberg’s domicile change at some point after September 2, 2004? When? To where?

